CHAPTER.VERS:
Take heed in the plague of leprosy, that you observe diligently, and do according to all that the priests the Levites will teach you

          {+}
        : as I commanded them, so you

          {+}
         will observe to do.

Remember what Yahweh your God did to Miriam, by the way as you

          {+}
         came forth out of Egypt.
